  "description": "JODPAV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H51 Dy4 N16 O23 1+,6(C2 H3 N1),N1 O3 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.549-5.472 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.84-174.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H69Dy4N23O27. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
